msgstr "Status of sources and products"

msgid "Un producto 'desactualizado' o 'sin datos' no detiene el resto del portal — cada producto se degrada por separado."
msgstr "A 'stale' or 'no data' product doesn't stop the rest of the portal — every product degrades on its own."

